recommend keep-going the queue now names run_in_forbear at 10 rungs by 137 lines and seat_the_history at 17 by 72, with read_the_finding at 20 by 55 and book_the_debt at 18 by 54 behind them -- read the harness first the way this lap did, since the_finding is already a named movement in ladder_checks beside the_standing and read_the_finding is plainly one of its steps, so the finding cluster is likely to fold whole the way the standing one just did; hash each family before trusting the count, hold every cohort list before the harness grows, and ask of each visibility split whether it is accident to heal or meaning to keep.
